# Sample requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request").
# Bruno and Postman can import or copy these too.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### --- Genres ---

### List genres
GET {{base}}/genres

### Create a genre
POST {{base}}/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Thriller" }

### --- Movies ---

### List movies (paginated, optional ?genre=<id>)
GET {{base}}/movies?page=1&limit=20

### Movies in one genre
GET {{base}}/movies?genre=3

### Get one movie
GET {{base}}/movies/1

### Create a movie
POST {{base}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "description": "A linguist is recruited to talk with alien visitors.",
  "posterUrl": "https://example.com/posters/arrival.jpg",
  "durationMinutes": 116,
  "genreIds": [3, 4]
}

### Update some fields (genreIds replaces the whole list)
PATCH {{base}}/movies/4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Arrival (2016)", "genreIds": [4] }

### Delete a movie (409 if it has showtimes, like movie 1)
DELETE {{base}}/movies/4

### --- Errors to try ---

### 400: several validation problems at once
POST {{base}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "durationMinutes": -5, "posterUrl": "javascript:alert(1)" }

### 400: malformed JSON
POST {{base}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title":
